  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这酒开了，你不先给我倒，先倒的是客，后到的是主。您是今天的主人，最后一杯满上代表压轴，全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯。你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对，怎么先敬别人，先把流程走完，最后踏踏实实坐下来，陪您慢慢喝好的，留到最杯。这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密。这吃到这个点儿了，你怎么还没敬敬一杯杯敬您的人排着队呢？我最后一个敬前面的酒，您喝的是场面。我这杯您喝的是收尾，代表今天的事儿圆满。这藕是藕，藕啊，就是心眼太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。怎么我来迟了，你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因，我等的就是信任到了，就是圆满。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导也要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导一杯，打这么多饭，你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说宰相肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。哈哈哈哈哈哈，我这字儿写的一般，你别为了哄我乱夸字，我确实不懂，但你一握笔，全屋都安静了。这个我懂。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你这人脾气挺好，没见你发过火发火，解决不了问题。您在前面顶着压力，我在后面添乱不合适。哈哈哈哈哈小王啊，我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，只能在EP上找些自我安慰了。哈哈哈哈，怎么你一来我茶杯盖就摔碎了，岁岁平安盖碎了一地，平安铺满一地。您今天出门步步都是平安。哈哈哈哈，我真不怎么喜欢你，但您从来没有在工作上为难过，我领导的格局值得我们学习。哈哈哈哈哈哈，家里没什么好茶，你就凑合喝吧茶叶好不好？得看怎么标价。您亲手倒的这杯，只讲情分，不讲价这鱼怎么点的这么赞。前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口。就像您听完汇报，最后来一句总结，清清爽爽，散会好好啊啊，来就来，带什么礼物啊，都不是外人。哎呀，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当长辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。哈哈请进你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话、会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我一解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的，这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 460,
      "end_ms": 1260,
      "text": "这酒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1340,
      "end_ms": 2220,
      "text": "你不先给我倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2760,
      "end_ms": 3540,
      "text": "先倒的是客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3540,
      "end_ms": 4300,
      "text": "后到的是主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4320,
      "end_ms": 5240,
      "text": "您是今天的主人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 5260,
      "end_ms": 6740,
      "text": "最后一杯满上代表压轴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 6800,
      "end_ms": 8665,
      "text": "全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 10470,
      "end_ms": 11710,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12030,
      "end_ms": 12430,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 12450,
      "end_ms": 13390,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 13410,
      "end_ms": 14570,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 14790,
      "end_ms": 16370,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 16370,
      "end_ms": 16950,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 16970,
      "end_ms": 18389,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 20150,
      "end_ms": 21970,
      "text": "你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 22210,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "怎么先敬别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 23070,
      "end_ms": 24190,
      "text": "先把流程走完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 24190,
      "end_ms": 25690,
      "text": "最后踏踏实实坐下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 25690,
      "end_ms": 26810,
      "text": "陪您慢慢喝好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 26810,
      "end_ms": 27230,
      "text": "留到最杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 27230,
      "end_ms": 31770,
      "text": "这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 31770,
      "end_ms": 32970,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 32970,
      "end_ms": 34830,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 34830,
      "end_ms": 35730,
      "text": "才守得住秘密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 35730,
      "end_ms": 38590,
      "text": "这吃到这个点儿了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 38590,
      "end_ms": 41540,
      "text": "你怎么还没敬敬一杯杯敬您的人排着队呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 41540,
      "end_ms": 42900,
      "text": "我最后一个敬前面的酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 42900,
      "end_ms": 43660,
      "text": "您喝的是场面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43660,
      "end_ms": 44780,
      "text": "我这杯您喝的是收尾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 44780,
      "end_ms": 48399,
      "text": "代表今天的事儿圆满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 48440,
      "end_ms": 49160,
      "text": "这藕是藕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 49160,
      "end_ms": 50080,
      "text": "藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 50080,
      "end_ms": 51300,
      "text": "就是心眼太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 52360,
      "end_ms": 54300,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 54460,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 57820,
      "end_ms": 58900,
      "text": "怎么我来迟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 59160,
      "end_ms": 61760,
      "text": "你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 61860,
      "end_ms": 64040,
      "text": "等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 64240,
      "end_ms": 65620,
      "text": "我等的就是信任到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 65620,
      "end_ms": 66945,
      "text": "就是圆满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 67900,
      "end_ms": 68300,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 68300,
      "end_ms": 69495,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 69840,
      "end_ms": 71675,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 71940,
      "end_ms": 72965,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 73300,
      "end_ms": 73980,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 74120,
      "end_ms": 75255,
      "text": "领导也要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 75430,
      "end_ms": 76650,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导一杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 77930,
      "end_ms": 78755,
      "text": "打这么多饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 79190,
      "end_ms": 79890,
      "text": "你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 80290,
      "end_ms": 80610,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 80610,
      "end_ms": 81310,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 81370,
      "end_ms": 83365,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 83530,
      "end_ms": 84930,
      "text": "都说宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 84990,
      "end_ms": 86235,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 86550,
      "end_ms": 87645,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 88280,
      "end_ms": 89585,
      "text": "我这字儿写的一般，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 89930,
      "end_ms": 91850,
      "text": "你别为了哄我乱夸字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 91850,
      "end_ms": 92695,
      "text": "我确实不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 93010,
      "end_ms": 93830,
      "text": "但你一握笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 93830,
      "end_ms": 94750,
      "text": "全屋都安静了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 94770,
      "end_ms": 95365,
      "text": "这个我懂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 96110,
      "end_ms": 97755,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 98010,
      "end_ms": 99385,
      "text": "你这人脾气挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 99990,
      "end_ms": 101910,
      "text": "没见你发过火发火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 101910,
      "end_ms": 102835,
      "text": "解决不了问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 103290,
      "end_ms": 104530,
      "text": "您在前面顶着压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 104530,
      "end_ms": 106135,
      "text": "我在后面添乱不合适。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 106830,
      "end_ms": 108645,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 109380,
      "end_ms": 111195,
      "text": "我看你穿衣品味不错嘛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 111760,
      "end_ms": 113965,
      "text": "思想上领导的高度我望尘莫及，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 114340,
      "end_ms": 116025,
      "text": "只能在EP上找些自我安慰了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 116420,
      "end_ms": 117275,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 117560,
      "end_ms": 119935,
      "text": "怎么你一来我茶杯盖就摔碎了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 120390,
      "end_ms": 122310,
      "text": "岁岁平安盖碎了一地，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 122310,
      "end_ms": 123470,
      "text": "平安铺满一地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 123570,
      "end_ms": 125645,
      "text": "您今天出门步步都是平安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 126060,
      "end_ms": 126925,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 127510,
      "end_ms": 128785,
      "text": "我真不怎么喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 130570,
      "end_ms": 132210,
      "text": "但您从来没有在工作上为难过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 132210,
      "end_ms": 134765,
      "text": "我领导的格局值得我们学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 135350,
      "end_ms": 136595,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 136750,
      "end_ms": 137850,
      "text": "家里没什么好茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 138110,
      "end_ms": 140440,
      "text": "你就凑合喝吧茶叶好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 140560,
      "end_ms": 141535,
      "text": "得看怎么标价。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 141890,
      "end_ms": 143030,
      "text": "您亲手倒的这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 143170,
      "end_ms": 143890,
      "text": "只讲情分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 143890,
      "end_ms": 146450,
      "text": "不讲价这鱼怎么点的这么赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 146450,
      "end_ms": 148930,
      "text": "前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 149070,
      "end_ms": 150310,
      "text": "就像您听完汇报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 150330,
      "end_ms": 151250,
      "text": "最后来一句总结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 151370,
      "end_ms": 151990,
      "text": "清清爽爽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 151990,
      "end_ms": 153740,
      "text": "散会好好啊啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 153810,
      "end_ms": 154370,
      "text": "来就来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 154710,
      "end_ms": 155710,
      "text": "带什么礼物啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 155750,
      "end_ms": 156645,
      "text": "都不是外人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 156930,
      "end_ms": 157230,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 157230,
      "end_ms": 157810,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 157810,
      "end_ms": 158450,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 158530,
      "end_ms": 159930,
      "text": "我一直都把您当长辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 159950,
      "end_ms": 162095,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 162690,
      "end_ms": 165345,
      "text": "哈哈请进你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 165620,
      "end_ms": 166545,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 166860,
      "end_ms": 169000,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 169200,
      "end_ms": 170960,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 171040,
      "end_ms": 172920,
      "text": "那些会说话、会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 173020,
      "end_ms": 174180,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 174260,
      "end_ms": 175000,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 175100,
      "end_ms": 175960,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 176020,
      "end_ms": 177275,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 177620,
      "end_ms": 179515,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本闲谈高手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 179840,
      "end_ms": 182035,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 182360,
      "end_ms": 183540,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 183680,
      "end_ms": 185085,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 185360,
      "end_ms": 187980,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 188100,
      "end_ms": 189480,
      "text": "在这本书里有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 189500,
      "end_ms": 190375,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 190720,
      "end_ms": 190880,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 190880,
      "end_ms": 192915,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 193160,
      "end_ms": 193875,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 194340,
      "end_ms": 195260,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 195340,
      "end_ms": 196715,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 197030,
      "end_ms": 198650,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 198770,
      "end_ms": 200465,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 200780,
      "end_ms": 201740,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 201840,
      "end_ms": 204880,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 204960,
      "end_ms": 206140,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 206340,
      "end_ms": 207645,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 207940,
      "end_ms": 209240,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 209540,
      "end_ms": 210995,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 211260,
      "end_ms": 212540,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 212620,
      "end_ms": 214475,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 214790,
      "end_ms": 215995,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 216310,
      "end_ms": 218790,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 218790,
      "end_ms": 219490,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 219770,
      "end_ms": 222435,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 222690,
      "end_ms": 224010,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 224350,
      "end_ms": 225730,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 225990,
      "end_ms": 228495,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 228820,
      "end_ms": 229860,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 230100,
      "end_ms": 232455,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_38c8fc48799ea7a4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 232880,
      "end_ms": 234565,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
